@MiddleOfMayhem (1) everybody saw a UFO fly over, so they went to cameras which should have been working there. 
but there was no image. when they checked why, it turned out that the cables had been cut, while still inside a conduit underground!
(2) he and another man saw someone (thing)

@realDavidBauer The translated text and two bitmap files are shown here. They are living underground in burial vaults, and preparing to build the Third Temple, where the Dome of the Rock "used" to be (in their future timeline). 
Slide 2 shows the exact lat-long point or origin. 
